WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.362
ArriveCAN Timeline.

00:00:02.312 --> 00:00:14.525
What started in March 2020 as an 80,000 dollar border screening tool ballooned to 59.5 million dollars through over 40 contract amendments under emergency COVID procurement rules.

00:00:14.525 --> 00:00:20.937
The Auditor General found the final cost could not be verified because documentation was so poor.
